## Implementation Guidelines

### Query Optimization
```php
function optimize_wp_query($query) {
  // Set posts per page
  $query->set('posts_per_page', 10);
  
  // Only get required fields
  $query->set('fields', 'ids');
  
  // Use proper indexing
  $query->set('orderby', 'ID');
  
  return $query;
}
add_action('pre_get_posts', 'optimize_wp_query');
```

### Caching Implementation
```php
function cache_api_response($response, $key, $expiration = 3600) {
  if (empty($response)) return false;
  
  $cache_key = 'api_cache_' . md5($key);
  return set_transient($cache_key, $response, $expiration);
}
```

### Asset Loading
```php
function optimize_asset_loading() {
  // Defer non-critical JavaScript
  add_filter('script_loader_tag', function($tag, $handle) {
    if ($handle !== 'jquery') {
      return str_replace(' src', ' defer src', $tag);
    }
    return $tag;
  }, 10, 2);
  
  // Add preload for critical assets
  add_action('wp_head', function() {
    echo '<link rel="preload" href="critical.css" as="style">';
  });
}
```

